    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"TBC crack: joystick routine. The TBC loader KP calls it from the IRQ in joystick mode (JSR $4800 at $09fc). It moves the cursor with joystick port 1."},
    {"at":40,"placement":"line","text":"Writes the joystick position to pad_y_raw and pad_x_raw."},
    {"at":51,"placement":"side","text":"Joystick Y position: up (bit 0) decrements it, down (bit 1) increments it."},
    {"at":52,"placement":"side","text":"Joystick X position: left (bit 2) decrements it, right (bit 3) increments it."}
